’ ceremony that recognizes alumni for five decades of upholding Sewanee’s charge to graduates.","short_summary":"A special 50th-reunion ceremony welcoming alumni into the Exornati Society.","evidence_claim":"The University describes its 50th-reunion tradition as long and storied and says reunion classes are inducted into the Exornati Society at an All Saints’ event.","source_url":"https://new.sewanee.edu/offices/university-offices/university-relations/partners/class-of-1973/","source_title":"Class of 1973: 50th Reunion","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This ceremony is for 50th-reunion classes; confirm the current reunion schedule with University Relations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
